        <p>Average final SOC is 98.5%, with median at 100% — virtually every vehicle charges to full. While this serves the customer, it maximizes session duration and bay occupancy. Offer a pricing incentive (e.g., 5% discount) for sessions that exit at 80% SOC. Modelling suggests this could reduce average session duration by ~15–20%, directly expanding effective network capacity. This is especially relevant at congested Peak-hour stations where bay turnover is the limiting factor.</p>
